r code, none of which was scored\"\n  - evidence: paper_data.json idea_titles and downstream_study.attempt_counts. source_evidence/ contains only the baseline and selected program, which are identical starter code, and no variant code.\n  - requested_fix: Say the agent proposed three variants that produced no score. Remove \"wrote their code\" unless it is qualified as unverified.\n\n## Soft warnings\n- figures[0] labels too long without abbreviation\n- figures[0].font_sizes.title below minimum: 8.5 < 10.0\n- figures[0].font_sizes.axis below minimum: 8.0 < 9.0\n- figures[0] PNG width too small: 1339 < 2400\n- figures[1].font_sizes.title below minimum: 9.5 < 10.0\n- figures[1] PNG width too small: 1686 < 2400\ndraft_reference_gaps.json\ndraft_reference_gaps.md\ndraft_reference_gaps_agent_claude_20261028_212829.log\ndraft_reference_gaps_prompt.md\ndraft_reference_gaps_validation_feedback.json\ndraft_reference_gaps_validation_feedback.md\npostdraft_citation_weave_agent_claude_20261028_212829.log\npostdraft_citation_weave_prompt.md\npostdraft_reference_query_plan.json\npostdraft_reference_query_plan.md\npostdraft_reference_query_plan_agent_claude_20261028_212829.log\npostdraft_reference_query_plan_prompt.md\npostdraft_reference_query_plan_validation_feedback.json\npostdraft_reference_query_plan_validation_feedback.md\npostdraft_reference_retrieval.log\npostdraft_references.bib\npostdraft_references_provenance.json\n5945 paper.tex","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
